($t$it$t$, $t$dail-eireann-et-seanad-eireann-source$t$, $t$<strong>Dáil Éireann e Seanad Éireann</strong>: fonte <strong>ufficiale</strong>, l'API di dati aperti delle Camere dell'Oireachtas (<a href="https://api.oireachtas.ie/">api.oireachtas.ie</a>): totali, risultato, elenco dei membri Tá (a favore), Níl (contro) e Staon (astensione), <strong>mandati e partiti datati</strong>. Licenza: <a href="https://www.oireachtas.ie/en/open-data/license/">Oireachtas (Open Data) PSI Licence</a>, che riprende la licenza Creative Commons CC BY 4.0 (attribuzione).$t$, $t$<strong>Dáil Éireann et Seanad Éireann</strong> : source <strong>officielle</strong>, l'API de données ouvertes des Chambres de l'Oireachtas (<a href="https://api.oireachtas.ie/">api.oireachtas.ie</a>) : totaux, résultat, liste des membres Tá (pour), Níl (contre) et Staon (abstention), <strong>mandats et partis datés</strong>. Licence : <a href="https://www.oireachtas.ie/en/open-data/license/">Oireachtas (Open Data) PSI Licence</a>, qui reprend la licence Creative Commons CC BY 4.0 (attribution).$t$),
